WEBVTT

00:00:02.173 --> 00:00:03.008
AS LONG AS
DUMBLEDORE'S AROUND,

00:00:03.052 --> 00:00:05.315
YOU CAN'T BE TOUCHED.

00:00:10.537 --> 00:00:11.930
Hermione: I'D ALWAYS HEARD

00:00:11.974 --> 00:00:14.324
HOGWARTS' END-OF-YEAR EXAMS
WERE FRIGHTFUL.

00:00:14.367 --> 00:00:16.543
BUT I FOUND THAT
RATHER ENJOYABLE.

00:00:16.587 --> 00:00:18.284
SPEAK FOR YOURSELF.

00:00:18.328 --> 00:00:20.286
ALL RIGHT THERE, HARRY?

00:00:20.330 --> 00:00:24.377
MY SCAR.
IT KEEPS BURNING.

00:00:24.421 --> 00:00:25.770
IT'S HAPPENED
BEFORE.

00:00:25.813 --> 00:00:27.380
NOT LIKE THIS.

00:00:27.424 --> 00:00:28.860
Ron: PERHAPS YOU SHOULD
SEE THE NURSE?

00:00:28.903 --> 00:00:30.383
Harry: I THINK
IT'S A WARNING.

00:00:30.427 --> 00:00:32.298
IT MEANS
DANGER'S COMING.

00:00:32.342 --> 00:00:34.170
UHH!

00:00:37.564 --> 00:00:39.218
OH.

00:00:39.262 --> 00:00:41.481
OF COURSE.

00:00:41.525 --> 00:00:42.569
WHAT IS IT?

00:00:42.613 --> 00:00:44.006
DON'T YOU THINK
IT'S A BIT ODD

00:00:44.049 --> 00:00:45.311
THAT WHAT HAGRID WANTS
MORE THAN ANYTHING

00:00:45.355 --> 00:00:46.530
IS A DRAGON

00:00:46.573 --> 00:00:47.574
AND A STRANGER TURNS UP

00:00:47.618 --> 00:00:49.054
WHO JUST HAPPENS
TO HAVE ONE?

00:00:49.098 --> 00:00:50.882
I MEAN, HOW MANY
PEOPLE WANDER AROUND

00:00:50.925 --> 00:00:52.318
WITH DRAGON EGGS
IN THEIR POCKET?

00:00:52.362 --> 00:00:55.060
WHY DIDN'T
I SEE IT BEFORE?

00:00:55.104 --> 00:01:00.065
[PLAYING FLUTE]

00:01:00.109 --> 00:01:02.720
HAGRID, WHO GAVE YOU
THE DRAGON EGG?

00:01:02.763 --> 00:01:03.895
WHAT DID HE LOOK LIKE?

00:01:03.938 --> 00:01:06.115
I DON'T KNOW.
I NEVER SAW HIS FACE.

00:01:06.158 --> 00:01:07.116
HE KEPT HIS HOOD UP.

00:01:07.159 --> 00:01:08.160
THIS STRANGER, THOUGH,

00:01:08.204 --> 00:01:09.857
YOU AND HE MUST HAVE TALKED.

00:01:09.901 --> 00:01:12.077
WELL, HE WANTED TO KNOW

00:01:12.121 --> 00:01:14.079
WHAT SORT OF CREATURES
I LOOKED AFTER.

00:01:14.123 --> 00:01:16.473
I TOLD HIM. I SAID,
"AFTER FLUFFY,

00:01:16.516 --> 00:01:18.301
A DRAGON'S GONNA BE
NO PROBLEM."

00:01:18.344 --> 00:01:19.911
DID HE SEEM
INTERESTED IN FLUFFY?

00:01:19.954 --> 00:01:22.914
WELL, OF COURSE HE WAS
INTERESTED IN FLUFFY.

00:01:22.957 --> 00:01:25.308
HOW OFTEN TO YOU COME
ACROSS A 3-HEADED DOG,

00:01:25.351 --> 00:01:27.136
EVEN IF YOU'RE
IN THE TRADE?

00:01:27.179 --> 00:01:29.399
BUT I TOLD HIM,
I SAID--

00:01:29.442 --> 00:01:31.357
I SAID, "THE TRICK
WITH ANY BEAST

00:01:31.401 --> 00:01:32.489
IS TO KNOW
HOW TO CALM HIM."

00:01:32.532 --> 00:01:35.144
TAKE FLUFFY,
FOR EXAMPLE.

00:01:35.187 --> 00:01:36.232
JUST PLAY HIM
A BIT OF MUSIC,

00:01:36.275 --> 00:01:37.798
AND HE FALLS
STRAIGHT TO SLEEP.

00:01:39.974 --> 00:01:41.933
I SHOULDN'T HAVE
TOLD YOU THAT.

00:01:43.369 --> 00:01:45.806
WHERE YOU GOING? WAIT!

00:01:52.639 --> 00:01:54.119
WE HAVE TO SEE
PROFESSOR DUMBLEDORE,

00:01:54.163 --> 00:01:55.468
IMMEDIATELY!

00:01:55.512 --> 00:01:57.992
I'M AFRAID PROFESSOR
DUMBLEDORE IS NOT HERE.

00:01:58.036 --> 00:02:01.822
HE RECEIVED AN URGENT OWL
FROM THE MINISTRY OF MAGIC

00:02:01.866 --> 00:02:03.041
AND LEFT IMMEDIATELY
FOR LONDON.

00:02:03.085 --> 00:02:06.349
HE'S GONE? NOW?
BUT THIS IS IMPORTANT!

00:02:06.392 --> 00:02:08.612
THIS IS ABOUT
THE PHILOSOPHER'S STONE.

00:02:08.655 --> 00:02:10.962
HOW DO YOU KNOW--

00:02:11.005 --> 00:02:12.877
SOMEONE'S GOING
TO TRY AND STEAL IT.

00:02:14.487 --> 00:02:16.315
I DON'T KNOW HOW YOU THREE
FOUND OUT ABOUT THE STONE,

00:02:16.359 --> 00:02:19.144
BUT I ASSURE YOU, IT IS
PERFECTLY WELL-PROTECTED.

00:02:19.188 --> 00:02:22.321
NOW WOULD YOU GO BACK
TO YOUR DORMITORIES?

00:02:22.365 --> 00:02:23.540
QUIETLY.

00:02:32.505 --> 00:02:34.942
THAT WAS NO STRANGER
HAGRID MET IN THE VILLAGE.

00:02:34.986 --> 00:02:37.423
IT WAS SNAPE,
WHICH MEANS HE KNOWS

00:02:37.467 --> 00:02:38.468
HOW TO GET PAST FLUFFY.

00:02:38.511 --> 00:02:40.165
AND WITH
DUMBLEDORE GONE--

00:02:40.209 --> 00:02:42.254
GOOD AFTERNOON.

00:02:43.995 --> 00:02:46.737
NOW WHAT WOULD
THREE YOUNG GRYFFINDORS

00:02:46.780 --> 00:02:47.912
SUCH AS YOURSELVES

00:02:47.955 --> 00:02:52.873
BE DOING INSIDE
ON A DAY LIKE THIS?

00:02:52.917 --> 00:02:55.441
UH--

00:02:56.921 --> 00:02:58.531
WE--
WE WERE JUST--

00:02:58.575 --> 00:03:00.664
YOU WANT TO BE CAREFUL.

00:03:00.707 --> 00:03:03.101
PEOPLE WILL THINK
YOU'RE...

00:03:07.061 --> 00:03:09.151
UP TO SOMETHING.

00:03:20.249 --> 00:03:21.250
NOW WHAT DO WE DO?

00:03:21.293 --> 00:03:24.383
WE GO DOWN THE TRAP DOOR.

00:03:24.427 --> 00:03:26.472
TONIGHT.

00:03:37.788 --> 00:03:39.746
[CROAKING]

00:03:39.790 --> 00:03:42.445
TREVOR.

00:03:42.488 --> 00:03:42.810
TREVOR, SHH, GO!
YOU SHOULDN'T BE HERE.
